        "attributes": {
          "author": null,
          "body": "House of Student has raised USD 2 Million in a Seed funding round co-led by Saltwater Sutra and Nirmitsu Inspirational Ventures.\n\n28/07/2026\n\nHouse of Student operates a technology platform for student accommodation across global education destinations. It offers online booking and housing network management, and plans to expand into AI-enabled student support services, has raised USD 2 Million in a Seed funding round through a combination of equity and debt. The round was co-led by Saltwater Sutra and Nirmitsu Inspirational Ventures. The round also saw participation from Gautam Verlekar, Glen Fernandes, Richard McCallum, Ali Moosa, and existing investor Unilodgers.",
